          "segmentId": "m00355:alt:fig-00005-alt",
          "text": "The structures of Vestenamer and Norsorex are inside parentheses with subscript n. Vestenamer has ten carbon atoms and Norsorex has seven carbon atoms with two double bonds in each structure."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_31_05_005.jpg",
